          "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-058-liang:p013",
          "quote": "梁孝王長子買為梁王，是為共王；子明為濟川王；子彭離為濟東王；子定為山陽王；子不識為濟陰王。",
          "chapter_id": "c-shiji-058-liang",
          "work_id": "w-shiji",
          "book_id": "b-shiji-058",
          "source_id": "s-shiji-058-liang"
        },
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-058-liang:p015",
          "quote": "梁共王三年，景帝崩。共王立七年卒，子襄立，是為平王。",
          "chapter_id": "c-shiji-058-liang",
          "work_id": "w-shiji",
          "book_id": "b-shiji-058",
          "source_id": "s-shiji-058-liang"
        },
